@startuml
' The tidy version of closing: write, then wait. On a slow minute the
' receipt is false. Source for public/assets/img/two-orderings-tidy-close-*.png.
!include style.iuml
$lifelines()

B -> C : close and revoke (sent)
B -> S : POST the close's signature
S -> D : $wrong("delete sessions and grants")
S -> C : ask about the signature,\nup to 6 times, 2 s apart
... the chain is slow ...
S --> B : $wrong("receipt: contract closed")

note over B, C
  If the close never lands, the contract stays open,
  and the site can still draw from the reader's
  token account. The receipt says the opposite,
  and the reader has no reason to check it.
end note
@enduml
